Iran says it was ready to launch a major missile attack on 3 locations in Ukraine following Ukraine’s strike on an Iranian commercial vessel in the Caspian Sea a week ago, per IRGC Maj. Gen. Mohsen Rezaei to Tasnim.

Iran adds it canceled the strike after Ukraine directly apologized to Iran and called the strike on the Iranian ship a mistake.
